# Install and build output produced by docs/operator-quickstart.md.
# The repo had no .gitignore, so following the quickstart left ~200 MB of
# node_modules staged for anyone who ran `git add -A`.
#
# `.svelte-kit/` was here for the SvelteKit appview scaffold, removed
# 2026-09-07 in favour of a cljs (reagent + re-frame + jp-go-dds) one — see
# appview/gameya-play-canvas/cljs/.gitignore for its own build output
# (`.shadow-cljs/`, `out/`, `public/js/`). `node_modules/` below already
# covers cljs/node_modules too (gitignore patterns without a leading slash
# match at any depth), so it is not repeated per-directory.

node_modules/
.wrangler/
